WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.770
Here are two vouchers,
and you can only use one.

2
00:00:03.820 --> 00:00:07.770
Voucher one gives you twenty
per cent off forty-five pounds.

3
00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:11.038
Voucher two gives you forty-five
per cent off twenty pounds.

4
00:00:11.088 --> 00:00:14.870
Forty-five per cent sounds
like a much bigger discount.

5
00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:17.670
So which voucher saves you more money?

6
00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:20.150
Think fast, before the shop closes!

7
00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:22.990
In this mission, you'll
switch between fractions,

8
00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:24.600
decimals and percentages.

9
00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:27.130
You'll find a percentage
of any amount,

10
00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:28.730
using simple building blocks.

11
00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:33.010
And you'll round numbers to make
quick estimates in your head.

12
00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:36.580
Your mission: work out which
voucher saves you more.
